{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X对人物动机和心理转折的因果交代不如Y直白，部分感受词连续堆叠时，也不容易马上看出它们与人物念头的关系。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的主线句更短，重点词突出，分时出现的感受词又能配合音乐进程，普通观众可以先抓住人物此刻的念头，再捕捉具体的听觉和身体感受。Y的长句更擅长解释人物为什么这样想，也更容易把前后心理变化串成完整故事，但边听边读时需要投入更多注意力。综合来看，我选X，因为它在扫读、抓取要点和音乐感受的细腻程度上更有优势，而Y的优势主要在叙事解释和因果连贯性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e8ac477e-7253-4620-8ba7-09373600c473", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T114829664279Z", "elapsed_seconds": 92.468, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T11:50:02.137667+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1a1fdccabe11081cefa55ed5470dde134992baf92de993587d8289747fbbd4c9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachmen